<title>USA: Norfolk tenders 2.6 mln Conrail shrs.</title>
<headline>Norfolk tenders 2.6 mln Conrail shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NORFOLK, Va. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norfolk Southern Corp said Wednesday that about 2,568,000 shares of Conrail Inc had been tendered as of the afternoon of January 7.</p>
<p>Norfolk Southern also said it was extending its tender offer through midnight January 24.  </p>
<p>Norfolk is offering $115 per share in cash for each Conrail share in its bid for the Philadelphia rail company.</p>
<p>Rival CSX Corp, which is seeking to combine with Conrail in a friendly merger, has bought 19.9 percent of Conrail stock at $110 cash per share.</p>
</text>
